---
/**
 * Hero.astro — Hero_Section
 *
 * The introductory section that presents the owner's identity, a subheadline,
 * and two call-to-action anchors for in-page navigation.
 *
 * - Single <h1> identity (Requirement 4.1)
 * - Subheadline referencing robust system architecture + photorealistic design
 *   (Requirement 4.2)
 * - "View Engineering Projects" CTA → #projects (Requirements 4.3, 4.5)
 * - "View 3D Renders" CTA → #gallery (Requirements 4.4, 4.6)
 * - Semantic <section> markup (Requirement 3.1)
 *
 * Navigation is framework-free: native anchor links scroll to the section
 * `id`s defined by Projects.astro (#projects) and Gallery.astro (#gallery).
 * The monochromatic theme tokens (neutral scale + `--color-accent`) are
 * consumed via Tailwind utilities (`text-accent`, `bg-accent`, etc.).
 */
---

<section
  id="hero"
  class="relative flex min-h-[80vh] items-center bg-neutral-950 px-6 py-24 text-neutral-50 sm:px-8 md:min-h-screen md:py-32"
>
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-4xl">
    <p class="mb-4 text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent sm:text-base">
      Building &amp; Visualizing
    </p>

    <h1
      class="text-balance text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl"
    >
      Full-Stack Software Engineer &amp; 3D Architectural Visualizer
    </h1>

    <p
      class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-pretty text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-300 sm:text-xl md:mt-8"
    >
      Focused on robust system architecture and photorealistic design — engineering
      scalable, secure software while crafting immersive, photorealistic 3D
      architectural visualizations.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center md:mt-12">
      <a
        href="#projects"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-neutral-50 transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-accent/90 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-neutral-950"
      >
        View Engineering Projects
      </a>

      <a
        href="#gallery"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-accent px-6 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-accent transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-accent hover:text-neutral-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-neutral-950"
      >
        View 3D Renders
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
